							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Anything built after the walk that needs the file is built during the walk and recorded with the reference. The supertype's source anchor is recorded in {{gtMethod:GtSmaCCKotlinImporter>>visitClassDeclaration:}} and used in {{gtMethod:GtSmaCCKotlinImporter>>resolveSuperTypeReferences}}."
