							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "`currentFile` is stale after the walk. Code that runs after it must not call `sourceAnchorFrom:`. {{gtExample:GtSmaCCKotlinExamples>>superTypeForwardReference|noCode}} asserts the inheritance's `sourceText`, which catches this; {{gtExample:GtSmaCCKotlinExamples>>inheritanceBetweenClassesInTheSamePackageSourceAnchor|noCode}} alone only passed because of the file order."
